INSERT INTO category_content (category_slug, section_order, subheading, paragraphs, created_at, updated_at) VALUES
('desktop-computers', 3, 'Benefits of Choosing a Desktop Personal Computer', '["Investing in a desktop personal computer offers unmatched versatility and reliability. These systems support a wide range of tasks, from professional work and home office setups to gaming and multimedia projects. A desktop personal computer ensures consistent performance, stability, and ease of maintenance, providing peace of mind for users who rely on their systems daily.","Unlike portable devices, a desktop personal computer allows for straightforward upgrades and component replacements, making it easier to maintain optimal performance. From expanding memory and upgrading storage to installing high-performance peripherals, a desktop computer can be tailored to suit specific requirements. Choosing a desktop personal computer from Rouge Technologies guarantees access to quality-tested systems designed to deliver exceptional computing experiences for years to come.","Whether you need a desktop computer for everyday productivity, a PC desktop computer for professional and creative tasks, or a desktop personal computer for reliable home use, Rouge Technologies provides options that combine performance, flexibility, and durability. Each system is designed to support modern software demands, ensuring a seamless, efficient, and enjoyable computing experience."]', unixepoch(), unixepoch()),
('computer-components', 0, NULL, '["Building or upgrading a PC starts with selecting the right computer components. Whether you are looking to shop computer components for a custom build, upgrade existing hardware, or enhance system performance, Rouge Technologies offers a comprehensive range of high-quality products. From motherboards and processors to memory modules and storage drives, our selection of computer parts hardware ensures that your system operates efficiently and reliably."]', unixepoch(), unixepoch()),
('computer-components', 1, 'Shop Computer Components for Every Build', '["When you shop computer components at Rouge Technologies, you gain access to products suitable for all types of builds and budgets. Whether constructing a high-performance gaming rig, a professional workstation, or a reliable everyday PC, our components provide the performance, durability, and compatibility needed. Customers can browse a wide variety of processors, graphics cards, RAM, SSDs, and cooling solutions, allowing for complete customization of their PC setup.","Shopping computer components also means you can tailor your system to your exact requirements. Gamers can prioritise high-end graphics cards and fast processors, while creative professionals might focus on memory and storage for intensive applications. By choosing the right computer components, you ensure your system performs optimally for multitasking, gaming, design, or productivity."]', unixepoch(), unixepoch()),
('computer-components', 2, 'High-Quality Computer Parts Hardware', '["Using quality computer parts hardware is essential to building a reliable and long-lasting system. Every component, from motherboards and CPUs to storage drives and power supplies, impacts the overall performance of your PC. High-quality hardware reduces the risk of failures, provides consistent speed, and ensures efficient operation even under heavy workloads. Investing in premium computer parts hardware allows you to create a PC that is both powerful and future-proof.","Rouge Technologies carefully selects each piece of computer parts hardware to meet rigorous standards for compatibility, performance, and reliability. Whether you are upgrading a single component or assembling a complete system from scratch, our hardware ensures that every PC components installation is seamless, secure, and optimized for your computing needs."]', unixepoch(), unixepoch()),
('computer-components', 3, 'PC Components for Performance and Flexibility', '["Modern PC components offer versatility and scalability for a wide range of applications. From gaming and content creation to professional and everyday computing, the right components enable you to build a system that matches your needs. Components such as high-speed SSDs, powerful GPUs, and efficient cooling solutions ensure that your PC delivers peak performance while remaining stable and reliable.","By focusing on quality PC components, customers can achieve long-term performance, reduce maintenance needs, and upgrade their systems as technology advances. Shop computer components at Rouge Technologies to access a curated selection of hardware that supports efficiency, durability, and high performance. With the right PC components, your system will deliver a smooth, reliable, and enjoyable computing experience for years to come."]', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
